# Acts of Evil (Q171), through cond 10: a level 27 human fighter accepts at Alvah; Arodin sends
# it to Tyra, who wants twenty blade molds; with eighteen held, a Turek orc archer drops the
# nineteenth (the support troop's 25% roll misses) and another the twentieth; Tyra's bill goes back
# to Arodin; Alvah asks for the ranger reports, which the Tumran bugbears give (the first always,
# the others at 20%); an Ol Mahum general gives the weapon trade contract and attack directives;
# Neti, Rolento and Burai pass the hunter on to the Ol Mahum captains, the first of which misses its
# head and the second drops it; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario; the support troop is the Boot test's (q171_troop_test.go).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q171_acts_of_evil.golden
character Hunter 27
hold 4239 18
random 0 99 0 99 0 0 0 0 999999 0
script quest.Q171_ActsOfEvil
